#. Tag: para
#: inserttext.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The digiKam image plugin <emphasis>Insert Text</emphasis> "
"is a tool for adding text to an image."
msgstr ""
"កម្មវិធីជំនួយ​រូបភាព​របស់ digiKam <emphasis>បញ្ចូល​អត្ថបទ​</emphasis> "
"ឧបករណ៍​សម្រាប់​បន្ថែម​អត្ថបទ​នៅក្នុង​រូបភាព ។"

#. Tag: keyword
#: inserttext.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid "<keyword>KDE</keyword>"
msgstr "<keyword>KDE</keyword>"

#. Tag: keyword
#: inserttext.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid "Digikam"
msgstr "Digikam"

#. Tag: title
#: inserttext.docbook:31
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "សេចក្តីណែនាំ​"

#. Tag: para
#: inserttext.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is a handy plugin as it lets you add formatted text easily to an image "
"wherever you want, at several places when needed."
msgstr ""
"នេះជា​កម្មវិធី​ជំនួយ​​ដ៏ងាយ​​ដែល​វា​អនុញ្ញាត​ឲ្យ​អ្នក​បន្ថែម​អត្ថបទ​ដែល​បានធ្វើទ្រង់ទ្រាយ​​របស់​រូបភាព ពេល "
"ដែលអ្នកចង់​បាន​​នៅទីតាំង​ដែលចាំបាច់​។​"

#. Tag: title
#: inserttext.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using the Plugin"
msgstr "ការប្រើប្រាស់​កម្មវិធី​ជំនួយ "

#. Tag: para
#: inserttext.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This plugin seems very intuitive to use. Type in your text and place it with "
"the mouse. Use the block settings as you please. Choose the orientation, color "
"from a color space, and fonts with all their properties. You will have to scale "
"the font size to the image size, the larger the image, the larger the font has "
"to be! Finally choose to add a border around the text and/or a semitransparent "
"background. Voilà, it's finished!"
msgstr ""
"កម្មវិធី​ជំនួយ​This plugin seems very intuitive to use. Type in your text and place it with "
"the mouse. Use the block settings as you please. Choose the orientation, color "
"from a color space, and fonts with all their properties. You will have to scale "
"the font size to the image size, the larger the image, the larger the font has "
"to be! Finally choose to add a border around the text and/or a semitransparent "
"background. Voilà, it's finished!"

#. Tag: para
#: inserttext.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Any text setting you have chosen can always be changed as long as you don't "
"click the OK button. In saved and reloaded images the text has become part of "
"the image, it can't be changed anymore."
msgstr ""
"ការកមណត់​អត្ថបទ​មួយ​ចំនួន​ដែល​បាន​ជ្រើស​រើស​​អាច​ផ្លាស់ប្តូរ​ដរាប​ណា​អ្នកមិន​ចុច​ប៊ូតុង​ យល់ព្រម​ជានិច្ច ។ "
"អត្ថបទ​រូបភាព​ដែល​បាន​រក្សាទុក​ និង​ផ្ទុក​ឡើង​វិញ​បាន​ក្លាយ​ជា​ផ្នែក​មួយ​នៃ​រូបភាព​ វា​មិន​អាច​ផ្លាស់ប្តូរ​ទៀត​ទេ​ ។"

#. Tag: title
#: inserttext.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid "The plugin in action"
msgstr "កម្មវិធី​ជំនួយ​កំពុង​មានសកម្មភាព "

#. Tag: para
#: inserttext.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Insert Text dialog tool in action is shown below."
msgstr "ប្រអប់​ឧបករណ៍​បញ្ចូល​អត្ថបទ​កំពង់​មាន​សកម្មភាព បាន​បង្ហាញ​ដូចខាងក្រោម​នេះ "

